  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#structuredclone step 22.3 loops through input.[[OwnPropertyKeys]]() and checks enumerabiliy for each one before then doing input.[[Get]](key, input). @ajklein pointed out that this does not match implementations.\n\nIn particular, if a getter changes the enumerability of another property later in the enumeration, currently we will ignore that changed property, whereas implementations currently would include it (since they do a snapshot of all \"enumerable own properties\", per the old spec).\n\nSo basically you need a two-step process. Probably what you want to do is just call https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-enumerableownnames first, then loop over doing [[Get]]s.\n",
